From 983859981fa1e08e4514cd39c27e4f59d33addfc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pranav Vashi <neobuddy89@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 11:21:49 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/32] Launcher3: Bring back QuickSpace events

(cherry picked from commit b18344f317f9bc7c6f847dee10b122ab0339ac3c)

Adapt to Lineage:
- LauncherPrefs: only QuickSpace keys (pref_quickspace*)
- Manifest: only QuickSpace permissions (no freeform/recents perms)
- cr_strings.xml: only QuickSpace strings (20)
- cr_config.xml: only reserved_container_workspace id
- Skip old settings UI (launcher_home_screen_preferences/SettingsHomescreen,
  LOS uses new prefs structure) and privapp whitelist
- QuickSpace replaces first-screen QSB container (upstream behavior)

Change-Id: Ie5e9b34f4d165dbc8ec1a716af6fc5888883697d
